      "created_at": "2014-02-14T16:22:50.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yeah, the most important part (Christopher and I worked on the wording of this forever) is that it does NOT increase damage he deals to himself (Setback does a lot of that), only to villain targets and from villain targets. &nbsp;It also doesn't affect damage he deals to the envrionment, but self-damage is way more relevant for him.</p>",
