      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/e9bcb4/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-02-14T16:41:06.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Wrong Time and Place also changed from the proof version, I noticed when playing last night. &nbsp;It's now the first time a hero target would take damage each turn, you can choose to redirect to Setback, who can then choose whether or not to redirect. &nbsp;It was a monster card playing against the V5 (and keeping the unlucky pool under control with Looking Up out)</p>",
