      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/7feea3/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-08-04T12:41:33.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi all,</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I apologize for a slight thread necro, but I have a question that goes along with this card. &nbsp;How is the damage boost from high risk behaviour affected by token counts that aren't multiples of three. &nbsp;For example, if i have 4 unlucky tokens, am I at +1 or +2. &nbsp;</p><p><span>In a broader sense, is there a stated rule for rounding numbers in Sentinels? &nbsp;I am not sure if there are other cards that would encounter this issue.</span></p><p><span>Thanks! &nbsp;</span></p><p>First Post!</p>",
      "post_number": 10,
      "post_type": 1,
