      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Hi all,</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I apologize for a slight thread necro, but I have a question that goes along with this card. &nbsp;How is the damage boost from high risk behaviour affected by token counts that aren&#39;t multiples of three. &nbsp;For example, if i have 4 unlucky tokens, am I at +1 or +2. &nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">In a broader sense, is there a stated rule for rounding numbers in Sentinels? &nbsp;I am not sure if there are other cards that would encounter this issue.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Thanks! &nbsp;</span></p><p>First Post!</p>",
