      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/grysqrl/{size}/1909_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-08-04T12:44:56.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Don't think of it as rounding. You are just counting the groups of 3 that you have. You would get +1 for every complete set of 3 tokens that you have. Partial sets don't contribute anything. So:</p><p><strong>Tokens / Boost</strong><br>1/0<br>2/0<br>3/1<br>4/1<br>5/1<br>6/2<br>7/2<br>8/2<br>9/3<br>...</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 11,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:16:58.478Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
