      "raw": "<p>Don&#39;t think of it as rounding. You are just counting the groups of 3 that you have. You would get +1 for every complete set of 3 tokens that you have. Partial sets don&#39;t contribute anything. So:</p><p><strong><u>Tokens / Boost</u></strong><br />1/0<br />2/0<br />3/1<br />4/1<br />5/1<br />6/2<br />7/2<br />8/2<br />9/3<br />...</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
